    "type": "game",
    "name": "Moomi & Spike",
    "steam_appid": 2990880,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990880/extras/5ed57b030f4e15b27381863dbd533bd4.avif?t=1742497116\" width=550 height=308 /></span><br><br>Get ready to race through a vibrant, 3D world in Moomi &amp; Spike, a high-speed platformer where agility and storytelling collide! Join Moomi and Spike, as they dash, leap, and spin through a series of dynamic levels brimming with challenge and charm. Uncover a captivating tale filled with quirky characters, hidden secrets, and epic adventures. With precise controls, exhilarating speed, and an engaging narrative, Moomi &amp; Spike is a rollercoaster of fun that will keep you on the edge of your seat. Can you conquer the speed and unravel the story?",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990880/extras/5ed57b030f4e15b27381863dbd533bd4.avif?t=1742497116\" width=550 height=308 /></span><br><br>Get ready to race through a vibrant, 3D world in Moomi &amp; Spike, a high-speed platformer where agility and storytelling collide! Join Moomi and Spike, as they dash, leap, and spin through a series of dynamic levels brimming with challenge and charm. Uncover a captivating tale filled with quirky characters, hidden secrets, and epic adventures. With precise controls, exhilarating speed, and an engaging narrative, Moomi &amp; Spike is a rollercoaster of fun that will keep you on the edge of your seat. Can you conquer the speed and unravel the story?",
    "short_description": "Experience high-speed thrills and an engaging story in Moomi &amp; Spike, a 3D platformer where agile gameplay and a captivating narrative collide in a vibrant adventure!",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
